@startuml memory_flow

header Memory Process Flow - Chatboton
footer Confidential - AI Memory Architecture

title Memory Process: Short-Term to Long-Term Pipeline

actor User
participant "Chatboton Agent" as Agent
participant "Short-Term Memory Tool\n(commit_short_term_memory)" as STTool
database "Qdrant\n(short_term collection)" as STDB

box "Background Pipeline (every 1m)" #LightBlue
    participant "process_memory\nPipeline" as Pipeline
    participant "Memory Processor Agent\n(hertek mode)" as Processor
end box

database "Qdrant\n(long_term collection)" as LTDB
database "Neo4j\n(Graph RAG)" as GraphDB #Yellow

== Interaction Phase ==

User -> Agent: Sends message
activate Agent
Agent -> Agent: Search Long-Term Memory\n(even for "hi")
Agent -> LTDB: Vector Search (long_term)
LTDB --> Agent: Past context (if any)

Agent -> STTool: Call commit_short_term_memory(message)
activate STTool
STTool -> STTool: Generate Embeddings\n(nomic-embed-text)
STTool -> STDB: Insert Vector + Payload
STDB --> STTool: Success
STTool --> Agent: Confirmed
deactivate STTool
Agent -> User: Respond to user
deactivate Agent

== Memory Processing Phase (Background) ==

loop every 1 minute
    Pipeline -> STDB: Fetch new memories
    activate Pipeline
    Pipeline -> Processor: Analyze memory relevance
    activate Processor
    note right of Processor: Decide if memory is worthy\nof long-term storage
    Processor --> Pipeline: Worthy / Not Worthy
    deactivate Processor
    
    alt Memory is Worthy
        Pipeline -> Pipeline: Transform memory\n(summarize/extract entities)
        Pipeline -> LTDB: Store in long_term collection
        note right of LTDB: Vector similarity search\nused by search_long_term_memory
    end
    deactivate Pipeline
end

== Future Enhancements ==

note over STTool, GraphDB
  **Future Roadmap:**
  * **commit_short_term_memory**: Will produce nodes and embed them in Qdrant specific collections.
  * **search_long_term_memory**: Will utilize Graph RAG (Neo4j) alongside Vector Search for deeper context.
end note

STTool -[dashed]-> GraphDB : [Future] Produce Nodes
Agent -[dashed]-> GraphDB : [Future] Graph RAG Query

@enduml
